  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LWF Reconstr Kosovo 1</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LWF &#xc5;teruppbyggn Kosovo 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconstuction project in Kosovo 1999-2000. The aim is to restore houses in the region. This will provide an estimated 5 000 persons with accomodation during the winter. Swedish conterpart is LWF, Martti Pentinnen. The Sida contribution amounts to SEK 14 500 000 for 1999-2000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xc5;teruppbyggnad av Nordv&#xe4;stra Kosovo 1999-2000. Husreparationer som sker i form av sj&#xe4;lvhj&#xe4;lp. Ber&#xe4;knas kunna f&#xf6;rse ca 5,000 personer med bostad inf&#xf6;r vinterna. Svensk part &#xe4;r LWF, Martti Pentinnen. Sida-st&#xf6;d under 1999 och 2000 beraknas till SEK 14 500 000.</narrative>
  </description>
